        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Chris Spencer, Nick Cannon, Jamie Foxx, Wayans family\n- TV Shows: Wild 'N Out, All That, The Nick Cannon Show, America's Got Talent\n- Roles: writer, rapper, actor, comedian, director, screenwriter, film producer, entrepreneur, record producer, radio personality, television personality, host\n\nFacts:\n- Nick Cannon was born on October 8, 1980.\n- Nick Cannon is an American rapper, actor, comedian, director, screenwriter, film producer, entrepreneur, record producer, radio personality, and television personality.\n- Nick Cannon began his television career as a teenager on All That.\n- Nick Cannon later hosted The Nick Cannon Show, Wild 'N Out, and America's Got Talent.\n- Chris Spencer is a writer who worked on projects with the Wayans family and Jamie Foxx.\n- Chris Spencer significantly helped Nick Cannon create MTV's Wild 'N Out.",
